  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">20-SEGES &#x2013; Pilot Market Driven Organic Dairy Production in Indonesia (MDOD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective will contribute directly to: 1. SDG 8 through increased revenues at farm, dairy and supplier level, as well as creation of better jobs on farms, in cooperatives, in dairies and in support functions, such as milk collection, sales and distribution. 2. SDG 2 through increased productivity in the dairy value chain and sustainable dairy practices that are more resilient to climate fluctuations, will contribute to self-sufficiency within dairy production and promote better nutrition and local food security. 3. SDG 17 through the North-South/private-public-NGO cooperation, which represents a cross-sectorial and cross-geographical partnership to promote long term business relationships, innovation and knowledge-sharing for the benefit of the dairy sector development in Indonesia.</narrative>
  </description>
